  "label": "The person wearing the niqab is mapped as 'them' in the call to ban",
  "description": "The text 'ban them' directly refers to the person wearing the niqab in the visual material. The visual entity (person) is being mapped onto the textual pronoun 'them', creating an analogical mapping where the individual is identified as the target of the ban. This mapping is reinforced by the spatial arrangement and the confrontational tone of the meme, which frames the person as the object of the hateful sentiment.",
